      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've implemented a workaround for my stuff, setting voice distance to 1,000,000 and gain to 0.6 to ensure volumes are consistent and audible for all players inside a vehicle, volume spatialization is lost but it's only an issue for large planes really.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
