  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-01T21:47:55.681Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the last patch, which changed how voice audibility works, you can no longer hear players sitting near you inside a fast moving vehicle.\nOnce beyond around 70 meters per second or 140 knots, it seems VRChat no longer counts the other players inside the vehicle as close enough for you to hear.\nI believe it is possible to work around this by using the new options available in udon, but it really shouldn't be necessary, please make the range detection more robust when moving at high speed.\nCan be tested in world Test Pilots https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e4908cea-023b-4749-9ad7-a898b12996e7",
